{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后终于，期中考试开始了。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是我们各务台学院的学生第一次\\n在结女校进行知识水平测试。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": "这是我们各务台学院的学生第一次在结女校进行知识水平测试。", "plain_idx": 188, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一个月不到的时间里，在想方设法习惯新环境的基础上，\\n这是我们作为结女校学生的首次考试。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "一个月不到的时间里，在想方设法习惯新环境的基础上，这是我们作为结女校学生的首次考试。", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过——经过了这不到一个月的时间，\\n大家也渐渐有了集体意识。", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "不过——经过了这不到一个月的时间，大家也渐渐有了集体意识。", "plain_idx": 192, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说啊，真的好难啊！\\n　新吾新吾，你最后一道题做出来了吗？」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "「我说啊，真的好难啊！　新吾新吾，你最后一道题做出来了吗？」", "plain_idx": 194, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0157", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「做是做了……对不对就不好说了」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那道题简直就是魔鬼啊～\\n　不过其他题我都做出来了」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "「那道题简直就是魔鬼啊～　不过其他题我都做出来了」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0279", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你啊，比起后悔已经考完了的科目，\\n　不如好好应付下一门考试如何？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": "「你啊，比起后悔已经考完了的科目，　不如好好应付下一门考试如何？」", "plain_idx": 203, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0547", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「遇到了爱理教的题目」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0350", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，是吗。\\n　那个老师出题的倾向还是没变呢」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "「喔，是吗。　那个老师出题的倾向还是没变呢」", "plain_idx": 209, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0548", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐～\\n　我说不定已经不行了～～……」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": "「美羽学姐～　我说不定已经不行了～～……」", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0099", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不能现在就放弃啊，纱纱。\\n　后面还有其他考试啊」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「不能现在就放弃啊，纱纱。　后面还有其他考试啊」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0181", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真羡慕你没有考试啊，熊喵」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜♪」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0059", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说！\\n　怎么能把动物带进食堂里来呢！」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "「我说！　怎么能把动物带进食堂里来呢！」", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0549", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，太吵闹的话，会忘掉记住的东西的」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0351", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和你这种臭虫比，\\n　肯定还是我考得比较好！」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「和你这种臭虫比，　肯定还是我考得比较好！」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0100", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唯有这一点，不等成绩出来还不好说啊」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「讨论这种话题这么激烈，\\n　总觉得像是那种考不好的学生会做的事啊～」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": "「讨论这种话题这么激烈，　总觉得像是那种考不好的学生会做的事啊～」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0158", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「给我闭嘴你这臭虫的同伙！」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0101", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁不说话呢」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁……安洁已经不行了……\\n　未来的老爷，再见了……咽气」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「安洁……安洁已经不行了……　未来的老爷，再见了……咽气」", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0280", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有垫底的真让人安心啊……」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0102", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感谢你，安洁……我不会忘记你的……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么说得好像安洁真的死了一样？！」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0281", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
